{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12874","headline":"送客一归襄阳二归浔阳 · 韩翃","name":"送客一归襄阳二归浔阳","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"南驱匹马会心期，东望扁舟惬梦思。\n熨斗山前春色早，香炉峰顶暮烟时。\n空林欲访庞居士，古寺应怀远法师。\n两地由来堪取兴，三贤他日幸留诗。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩翃","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12874.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12874","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}